{"4891420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JobLoop", "steam_appid": 4891420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Job Loop is a first person role playing game. You will play as Justin, a candidate for a job interview. You will be stuck in a time loop and find a means to escape, or not. You will follow a story, or you will break the story apart. You will make choices, or choices will be made for you. This job will change your life, or it will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, dark mysteries of the company start to unravel, getting you closer and closer to finding out THE TRUTH. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role-playing in an immersive, first-person environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices and consequences, comedy, dialogue, skills and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game filled with people, some of whom are monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple solutions to problems and character development choices. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich: a detailed story based on robotics and advancements in technology. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Job Loop is a first person role playing game. You will play as Justin, a candidate for a job interview. You will be stuck in a time loop and find a means to escape, or not. You will follow a story, or you will break the story apart. You will make choices, or choices will be made for you. This job will change your life, or it will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, dark mysteries of the company start to unravel, getting you closer and closer to finding out THE TRUTH. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role-playing in an immersive, first-person environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices and consequences, comedy, dialogue, skills and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game filled with people, some of whom are monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple solutions to problems and character development choices. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich: a detailed story based on robotics and advancements in technology. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Job Loop is a first person role playing game. You will play as Justin, a candidate for a job interview. You will be stuck in a time loop, and find a means to escape, or not. You will follow a story, or you will break the story apart. You will make choices, or choices will be made for you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891420/433c04575a230a42ac289908bb6bb6fc9d60c01c/header.jpg?t=1787304377", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891420/026095669681840cc62ac6cc56d32d53bb56a857/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787304377", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891420/026095669681840cc62ac6cc56d32d53bb56a857/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787304377", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD equivalent with 4 physical cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 470 or AMD Radeon 6870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requi